{"parse": {"title": "矢车菊说起的那一年-06", "pageid": 141919, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%A2%E8%BD%A6%E8%8F%8A%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4-05\" title=\"矢车菊说起的那一年-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">矢车菊说起的那一年-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%A2%E8%BD%A6%E8%8F%8A%E8%AF%B4%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4-07\" title=\"矢车菊说起的那一年-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">矢车菊说起的那一年</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.B7.E9.9B.BE.E6.9C.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"迷雾月\">迷雾月</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 迷雾月</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">11.01.1991 雨</span></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">柏林以东家中（下午）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><small style=\"color: #999;\">翻开日记本</small><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n<i style=\"display:block; color:#b2b2b2; border:1px dotted #bbb; border-radius:10px; padding:10px; width:fit-content\">\n<b>1991/11/10  雨</b><br />\n我还在犹豫要不要用老师的推荐信。<br />\n我知道现在有大把的人找不到稳定点的工作，更不要说稍微高薪一点儿的。有得挑还犹豫，可能已经是一种傲慢了……<br />\n唉，没有谁真正知晓每个选择背后的代价。<br />\n当时和老师信誓旦旦说我想当个好人，现在回想起来也有点傻……<br />\n毕竟客观来说，现在的收入的确没有之前在史塔西任职时稳定——虽然我不能说那是一份“好工作”。<br />\n但房租是一大笔钱，吃饭——就算自己做，也总需要不少。更何况以后不再年轻，很多限制年龄的兼职可能也应聘不上。<br />\n有坑就不缺萝卜，他们总爱这样说。虽然难听，但对求职者而言，还真是这样啊……<br />\n要成为好人，不只需要善心，更需要……有能力。<br />\n如果当时不是我接下海伦娜的任务，而是别人，也许更不可能帮到她。<br />\n但对变幻的时代飓风下的普通人而言……要有为善的能力本就不易。<br />\n就像我不知道如果去基金会任职，我的神秘术又会被怎样利用……甚至我没什么权利担心这种贪求两全的问题。<br />\n如果加入了，我还能保持“天真的固执”吗？<br />\n但基金会在明面上是中立的，又有深厚的神秘学底蕴。去那里就职，也许能让我积累更多为善的能力。<br />\n也许这就是老师说的，在历史的广阔语境下，对错只是由一时的判断标准决定的吧。<br />\n只是对身处其间的我们来说，选择上的一点不同，也许意味着截然相反的命运。<br />\n先不写了，该去找洛尔交班了。</i>\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">MFC快餐店员工后厨（下午）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“洛尔，下午好！今天可真冷啊……冬天快到了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔点点头，拿出布巾替柏林以东擦了擦淋湿的肩膀。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“谢谢！等下你也记得带上雨伞。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔再次点点头，走到柏林以东背后，帮她系上了系带，一模一样的漂亮花结。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“洛尔，下次再——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>少女的道别被打断了。<br />\n洛尔打手势表示道歉。<br />\n她继续打手势说，自己申请到了其他国家的全奖博士候选人的资格，过段时间就准备离开柏林。<br />\n柏林以东在心里计算了一下日期——洛尔离职那天，她得去电台兼职。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“抱歉……我那天没办法和你当面道别。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔摇摇头，表示没关系，她走向前一步——<br />\n给了柏林以东一个大大的拥抱。<br />\n她缓慢而郑重地向柏林以东打手势。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“你——是——一个——很好的——朋友。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“谢谢你，洛尔。你不会知道……这句夸奖对我的意义。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洛尔接着比画了好长一句。大意是，很多时候，好人也得先自己过好，才能继续成为帮助别人的好人。<br />\n她询问柏林以东是否能给她一个地址。<br />\n“我们未来能以笔友的方式，继续做朋友吗？”<br />\n女孩比画着询问。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“你可以寄到……圣洛夫基金会德国柏林办事处的公开地址。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>柏林以东：</b></span>“我……把地址写在纸条上。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">11.01.1991 晴</span></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">柏林以东家中（下午）</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 13 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_13_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n<i>我决定……接受老师给我的机会。</i><br />\n<i>虽然促成这一切的动机，其实只是一个小小的执念：我想给我的朋友一个稳定的收件地址。</i><br />\n<i>我不知道未来会怎么变化，只知道我不愿意因为人生阶段的变化就失去一个朋友。</i><br />\n<i>真是一个连我自己都感到有点荒诞的理由……但这可能是我现在唯一能把握的东西。</i><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 07 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n少女看向窗边，矢车菊已经枯黄了大半，远处的山毛榉也稀疏了。<br />\n但明日开始，街头又会涌出一大批庆祝狂欢节的人。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"清理花盆\">清理花盆</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"不清理\">不清理</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"清理花盆\">\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 07 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #bc9567; padding: 0 5px;\"><big><b>完成选择：对一小片土地负责</b></big></span></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>柏林以东想，来年她会再种下新的种子。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"不清理\">\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>柏林以东想，来年她会再种下新的种子。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3020 gamepic 07 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png/130px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"130\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png/195px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png/260px-Rolestory_3020_gamepic_07_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"760\" data-file-height=\"424\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #bc9567; padding: 0 5px;\"><big><b>完成选择：对一小片土地负责</b></big></span></div>\n</div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "矢车菊说起的那一年-06"}}